                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "At Clarity Eye Institute, we believe exceptional vision care is both an art and a science. Our commitment to excellence is reflected in every aspect of our practice, from our state-of-the-art technology to our compassionate, personalized approach. With decades of combined experience, our team of renowned"
